WEBVTT

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:06.960
(EXHALES, SNIFFS) Ugh.

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:09.080
Did Elsa seem weird to you?

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:11.960
-She seemed like Elsa.
-Hmm.

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:13.440
-(CLEARS THROAT)
-That last word

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:15.440
really seemed to throw her.
What was it?

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:17.080
-I don't know. Ahem.
-No. No.

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:18.840
-I don't know, but...
-Ah.

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:20.440
"Ice"?

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.120
-Oh, come on!
-(RING CLINKING)

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:24.120
She couldn't act out ice?

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:25.920
-I better go check on her.
-Uh...

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.800
-Thanks, honey. Love you.
-Hmm?

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:31.680
Love you, too.

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:34.560
It's fine.

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:37.640
(RHYTHMIC KNOCKING ON DOOR)

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:38.800
ELSA: Come in.

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:42.080
Yep. Something's wrong.

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:44.040
-With you?
-No, with you.

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:45.960
You're wearing Mother's scarf.

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.080
You do that
when something's wrong.

00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:50.000
(GASPS) Did we hurt
your feelings?

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:51.480
I'm so sorry if we did.

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:53.960
You know, very few people are
actually good at family games.

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:55.040
That's just a fact.

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:57.280
No, that's not it.

00:00:57.440 --> 00:00:58.920
Then, what is it?

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:03.160
There's this...

00:01:03.720 --> 00:01:04.840
(SIGHS)

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:08.880
I just don't wanna
mess things up.

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:12.080
What things?
You're doing great.

00:01:12.160 --> 00:01:15.280
(SIGHS) Oh, Elsa, when are you
going to see yourself

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:16.640
the way I see you?

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:20.680
What would I do without you?

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:23.040
You'll always have me.

00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:25.080
(SIGHS SOFTLY)

00:01:25.160 --> 00:01:26.280
I know what you need.

00:01:26.360 --> 00:01:27.520
-Come on, come here.
-What?

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:28.880
In Mama's words,

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:31.680
-"cuddle close, scooch in."
-Mm-hmm.

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:35.080
(ELSA BREATHES DEEPLY)

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:37.640
(SINGING) Where the Northwind

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:40.000
Meets the sea

00:01:40.680 --> 00:01:42.880
There's a river

00:01:43.480 --> 00:01:45.280
Full of memory

00:01:45.400 --> 00:01:47.320
-I know what you're doing.
-(CHUCKLES)

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:51.920
Sleep, my darling,
safe and sound

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:56.880
For in this river,
all is found

00:01:58.360 --> 00:02:00.120
(YAWNS)

00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:05.120
(GRUNTS AND SNORTS)

00:02:11.880 --> 00:02:13.960
(ANGELIC VOICE VOCALIZING)

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:22.080
(VOCALIZING CONTINUES)

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:25.520
(GASPING)

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:29.880
(VOCALIZING CONTINUES)

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:36.080
(HUFFING)

00:02:38.480 --> 00:02:40.280
(SOFT MUSIC PLAYING)

00:02:42.960 --> 00:02:45.000
(SINGING) I can hear you

00:02:45.160 --> 00:02:46.640
But I won't

00:02:47.040 --> 00:02:49.080
Some look for trouble

00:02:49.240 --> 00:02:50.880
While others don't

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:56.480
There's a thousand reasons
I should go about my day

00:02:56.680 --> 00:03:02.080
And ignore your whispers
which I wish would go away, oh

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:04.160
(ANGELIC VOICE
CONTINUES VOCALIZING)

00:03:05.720 --> 00:03:06.840
Oh

00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:11.720
You're not a voice

00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:14.360
You're just
a ringing in my ear

00:03:14.440 --> 00:03:16.000
And if I heard you

00:03:16.080 --> 00:03:17.240
Which I don't

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:19.680
I'm spoken for, I fear

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:23.920
Everyone I've ever loved
is here within these walls

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:26.200
I'm sorry, Secret Siren

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:28.560
But I'm blocking out
your calls

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:32.720
I've had my adventure
I don't need something new

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:36.880
I'm afraid of what I'm risking
if I follow you

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:41.040
Into the unknown

00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:45.640
Into the unknown

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:51.160
Into the unknown

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:54.400
(ANGELIC VOICE VOCALIZING)

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:58.280
(ELSA SIGHS)

00:04:00.280 --> 00:04:02.160
What do you want?

00:04:02.640 --> 00:04:04.800
'Cause you've been
keeping me awake

00:04:05.280 --> 00:04:07.600
Are you here to distract me

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:09.880
So I make a big mistake?

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:14.640
Or are you someone out there

00:04:14.840 --> 00:04:17.080
Who's a little bit like me

00:04:17.240 --> 00:04:20.000
Who knows deep down

00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:23.520
I'm not where I'm meant to be?

00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:26.400
Every day's a little harder

00:04:26.560 --> 00:04:29.040
As I feel my power grow

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:34.320
Don't you know there's
part of me that longs to go

00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:38.840
Into the unknown?

00:04:39.240 --> 00:04:43.280
Into the unknown!

00:04:43.440 --> 00:04:47.760
Into the unknown!

00:04:47.840 --> 00:04:49.760
(ANGELIC VOICE VOCALIZING)

00:04:51.560 --> 00:04:53.280
Whoa-oh-oh

00:04:53.360 --> 00:04:55.280
Are you out there?
Do you know me?

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:59.800
Can you feel me?
Can you show me?

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:01.960
(VOCALIZES)

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:05.320
(ANGELIC VOICE AND ELSA
HARMONIZING)

